  "type": "Manifest",
  "id": "urn:accord:stagecraft:test-inn-ambush:84-roleosum-endpoint-migration",
  "dcterms:title": "Inn Ambush 84 Roleosum endpoint migration (slice 2 commit 4)",
  "dcterms:description": "TRANSITION CASE added 2026-08-15 (conformance-ladder discipline; sc.task.2026-07-29_0930 slice 2). Migrates the roleosum v1 carriers in the WORKING world state (Talla honest-trader value declaration; declarationTerm to rol:valueKind_ideal, the 2026-08-14 endpoint rename) and the contract pair (13 shape lines, 10 context mappings) to the family rol: namespace - including the TradePriceLine class, which the contract pair had bound under the v1 roleosum prefix to an IRI declared nowhere (slice-1 finding), now rol:TradePriceLine as the arm declares it. The quotedPriceItem/quotedPriceQuantity records exist only in conformance history (rungs kept as-is).",
  "hasCase": [
    {
      "type": "TransitionCase",
      "id": "#roleosum-endpoint-migration",
      "fixtureRepo": "github.com/spectacular-voyage/test-inn-ambush",
      "operationId": "stagecraft.fixture.migrateRoleosumToEndpoint",
      "fromRef": "3989d890154ccafbc84526115fecd8cf3a4e3e11",
      "toRef": "origin/b.32-roleosum-endpoint-migration",
      "fromState": {
        "type": "StateLocator",
        "locatorKind": "gitRefState",
        "ref": "3989d890154ccafbc84526115fecd8cf3a4e3e11"
      },
      "toState": {
        "type": "StateLocator",
        "locatorKind": "gitRefState",
        "ref": "origin/b.32-roleosum-endpoint-migration"
      },
      "hasFileExpectation": [
        {
          "id": "#projections-contracts-inn-ambush-contract-context-jsonld",
          "type": "FileExpectation",
          "path": "projections/contracts/inn-ambush-contract.context.jsonld",
          "changeType": "updated",
          "compareMode": "json"
        },
        {
